cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its released results, please cite the paper below."
title: "LP-CCAD Audit: reproducibility release"
abstract: >-
  Frozen results, configurations and analysis code for an audit of label-space
  curriculum distillation (LP-CCAD). A validation ordering signal that
  replicated across three seeds failed a prospectively locked test and a
  randomized follow-up matched on nominal exposure; the audit framework is
  the contribution.
  No dataset, imagery or checkpoint is included.
type: software
